ict during  this assault we can see how the marlene  army uses ldn soldiers in various  different ways some aldians are used as  basically cannon fodder  some are used as mindless titans and  those elite  aldian recruits who are part of the  warrior unit are trained to use the  various  titan shifter powers but what is the  warrior unit  the most promising ldn recruits inside  the marlin military  are selected at a very young age to  become warrior candidates  they are then extensively trained and  tested until a very small number  the very best of the best are eventually  selected to inherit  one of the titan shifter powers and as  we know because of the curse of emir  someone new  has to inherit a titan shifter power  every 13 years  so new recruits are needed now potential  warrior unit candidates are extensively  brainwashed with marlene propaganda  from a very young age they are raised to  believe that their ancestors were evil  monsters and spawn of the devil who did  terrible things to all other nations  they are also  raised to believe that all the aldeans  on the island of paradise  are pure evil and that it is every  warrior's duty to sacrifice their own  life  for marlei the warrior recruits are told  that sacrificing their life for marlei  is the only way for them to make up for  the sins of their fellow  aliens they are taught that showing  undying loyalty to marlei  is the only way to prove that not all  aldians are bad and evil monsters  some warrior recruits like annie saw  through this propaganda right away  but others like reiner and gabby bought  it wholeheartedly  on top of the blatant propaganda though  warrior recruits are also incentivized  to sacrifice their lives for marlei  with the promise of honorary marlayan  citizenship  honorary marlin citizenship is a special  status that is awarded to members of the  warrior unit  and their families and this status  allows them to avoid the constant  persecution and discrimination that all  the other  aldians face in marley in theory  this status is supposed to make them  something close to equal to the other  citizens of marley but it is highly  questionable whether an  ldn can ever truly be considered free  and equal in marleian society  the hatred of the marlenes for the  aldians runs very deep  and while some warrior recruits believe  that marland's citizenship  is a great honor others believe that  honorary marlin citizenship  is just a farce now the other titan  shifter that appears during the attack  on fort slava  the one with the crazy teeth and jaw is  the new  jaw titan this is the same titan shifter  power that was formerly controlled by  emir from the 104th training corps  but this power is now being controlled  by warrior unit member  porco galliard porco is actually the  younger brother of marcel galliard  and marcel is the boy who would control  the jaw titan initially before he was  eaten by emir's mindless titan on the  island of paradise some nine years  earlier but okay let's talk about the  war between marlei  and the mideast alliance and what  started it in the first place  basically marlei has been using their  titan powers and titan shifter powers in  particular  to dominate rival nations for nearly a  century however  once word got out that marlene not only  failed to capture the founding titan on  parodies but that they also managed to  lose control of the female  titan and the colossal titan the mid  east alliance decided this was the  perfect time to attack  that is how important titan shifter  powers have become  in global geopolitics the fact that  marlei  lost two of the titan shifters  emboldened their enemies to attack them  and as a result a bloody four-year war  erupted on the continent  luckily for marley they did ultimately  manage to win this war  as a result of their successful attack  on fort slava  but even though they technically came  out of this war as winners  marley still has a major problem they  have been relying 