wers  and only aldians can become titans  but because marlands have been using ldn  titans to subjugate  other nations for nearly 100 years those  other nations also hate aldians and see  them as dangerous  monsters so what do you think will  happen to the aldians  once titan powers are no longer an  important factor  in modern warfare the sad truth is that  once titan powers become  irrelevant on the battlefield the ldn  people will become disposable  everyone hates and fears them because of  their ability to turn into titans  and when they are no longer needed their  future will be  very bleak no one has any sympathy for  them  in marlei or in the other nations and  when we get to the point that no one  relies on the aldians and their titan  shifter powers anymore it is highly  likely that they will be completely  exterminated they are not viewed as  human beings by the marlenes and the  other global powers  they are viewed as monsters and devils  and so when they are no longer needed  for anything  they will likely be disposed of that is  the  ugly truth that every elder in marle who  is aware of the current geopolitical  situation has to grapple with including  zeke  reiner and all the others and that is  where we are  at this point in the story one big war  has just ended  but another one could erupt at any  moment modern weapons technology  is quickly surpassing the power of the  titans and that could mean big trouble  for the nation of marley  and for every single aldian living in  marley and of course the island of  paradise  is once again in the crosshairs of the  marlene military but  this time the marlans are going to be  facing a very different type of opponent  on the island if you enjoyed this video  definitely leave a like and comment to  let me know  and if you want to see me make a part 2  where i explain everything that happened  on the island of parodies itself during  the time skip  then make sure that we get this video to  15 000 likes and i wil